It's about the ability to ask the right questions, anticipate challenges, and collaboratively chart a course forward.

1377
01:54:38,900 --> 01:54:44,920
It's a dynamic interplay of analysis and action, all articulated through precise and purpose-driven dialogue.

1378
01:54:45,200 --> 01:54:56,460
These exchanges are real-world examples of how specific vocabulary, phrasing, and communication structures are used to achieve concrete business outcomes, making them invaluable for anyone looking to truly master business English.

